done-so-far: BUG-051's fix is proven end to end — the log now carries
  gateway_exit {reason: idle, idle_secs: 900}, which could not happen before because the doctor's
  probe reset the timer every 300s. But the wrong threshold won: idle-EXIT at 900 fires before
  idle-UNLOAD at 1200, so the model is never unloaded; the process exits, KeepAlive restarts it
  within seconds and it eagerly reloads the weights. Observed: uptime 870 -> 26.
next: file it, then order the two so a gateway that CAN reload unloads instead of exiting.
